 class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"112849\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>志願<rp>(</rp><rt>しがん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>採用<rp>(</rp><rt>さいよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He applied for the job and got it.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">サイレン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">警笛；汽笛；警报器</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74157\">サイレンが<ruby>急変<rp>(</rp><rt>きゅうへん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らせました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The siren sounded an emergency.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">幸い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さいわい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">幸福；幸运；福气；好运；幸而得到好结果；结果顺利；有幸告终；幸运地；幸而；幸好</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"234238\">あなたがここに<ruby>居<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たのは<ruby>幸<rp>(</rp><rt>さいわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いでした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You were fortunate to be here.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">サイン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">签名；亲笔签名；标志；信号；迹象</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">遮る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さえぎる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">打断（话语等）；阻挡；遮挡（视线、光线、风等）；拦截；阻隔</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"88840\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>目<rp>(</rp><rt>め</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>日差<rp>(</rp><rt>ひざ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しを<ruby>遮<rp>(</rp><rt>さえぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She used her hand to screen the sunlight from her eyes.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">囀る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さえずる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（鸟类等）唱歌；啼叫；鸣叫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"179475\"><ruby>空<rp>(</rp><rt>そら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>鳥<rp>(</rp><rt>とり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がさえずっていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Birds were singing in the sky.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">冴える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">清晰；明亮；鲜艳；清脆；头脑清醒；机灵；反应敏捷；精神饱满；看起来神采奕奕；精神抖擞；开朗活泼；精通；擅长；干净利落地完成；令人满意；变得严寒；变得极冷</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"81081\"><ruby>満月<rp>(</rp><rt>まんげつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>空<rp>(</rp><rt>そら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にさえている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">A full moon is shining bright in the sky.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">竿</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さお</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">竿；杆；棍；三味线等乐器的琴颈；三味线；天平横梁；秤杆；一字形飞行队列（尤指雁阵）；阴茎；旗帜（插于竿上）的计数词；羊羹等细长日式点心的计数词</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">坂</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">斜坡；山坡；坡道；标记；（年龄的）关卡</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"158090\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>何度<rp>(</rp><rt>なんど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>転<rp>(</rp><rt>ころ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>びながら、<ruby>坂<rp>(</rp><rt>さか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I went down the slope, falling again and again.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">境</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">边界；界限；转折点；分水岭；地区；区域；场所；空间；环境；心理状态；精神状态；认知对象；感官或心智所能感知的事物</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"103205\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>生死<rp>(</rp><rt>せいし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>境<rp>(</rp><rt>さかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をさ<ruby>迷<rp>(</rp><rt>まよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He hovered between life and death.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">栄える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さかえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">繁荣；昌盛；兴盛</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207799\">その<ruby>町<rp>(</rp><rt>まち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>栄<rp>(</rp><rt>さか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えているようだった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">That town looked prosperous.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">逆さ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さかさ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">倒转的；颠倒的；反向的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"110982\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はボールペンを<ruby>逆<rp>(</rp><rt>さか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さに<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He held a ball-point by the wrong end.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">逆さま</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さかさま</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">颠倒；倒立；反向；相反；反过来</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">杯</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さかずき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">